1
00:00:54,960 --> 00:00:56,119
Quit whining! Get moving!

2
00:00:56,119 --> 00:00:56,960
That drunk rich lady...

3
00:00:58,840 --> 00:00:59,799
Get lost, get lost!

4
00:01:01,479 --> 00:01:02,759
This pretty boy...

5
00:01:03,079 --> 00:01:04,719
He blew nearly three million of my money,

6
00:01:04,959 --> 00:01:07,159
and now he dares to harass me at my company?

7
00:01:07,959 --> 00:01:08,959
How did he get in?

8
00:01:09,400 --> 00:01:10,640
What are Yunding's security guards

9
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:11,519
and lobby manager doing?!

10
00:01:11,519 --> 00:01:12,400
I'm sorry, Chairwoman Shen.

11
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:13,519
I'll take care of it right now.

12
00:01:15,239 --> 00:01:16,439
This isn't a place you belong.

13
00:01:16,519 --> 00:01:16,959
Leave.

14
00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:18,040
Hey, I'm talking to you!

15
00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:19,359
How can you just use me and dump me?

16
00:01:19,359 --> 00:01:20,439
Is this how you do your jobs?

17
00:01:21,359 --> 00:01:21,959
Linna.

18
00:01:22,599 --> 00:01:23,640
Our boss has already spoken.

19
00:01:23,640 --> 00:01:24,439
Hurry up and get out!

20
00:01:24,439 --> 00:01:24,840
Hold on, little sister!

21
00:01:24,840 --> 00:01:25,640
Who's your sister?!

22
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:26,719
If you dare cause trouble here again,

23
00:01:26,719 --> 00:01:28,000
believe me, I'll call the cops on you!

24
00:01:29,519 --> 00:01:30,319
Sis!

25
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:31,480
It's a misunderstanding.

26
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:32,879
I just wanted to ask,

27
00:01:32,879 --> 00:01:33,920
that beauty just now,

28
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:35,120
is she a client here?

29
00:01:35,439 --> 00:01:36,879
He doesn't know who Chairwoman Shen is?

30
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:38,920
Some social circles

31
00:01:39,079 --> 00:01:41,040
aren't something you can crash

32
00:01:41,040 --> 00:01:42,079
just by acting shameless and pestering people.

33
00:01:42,159 --> 00:01:42,640
Security!

34
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:43,519
Linna!

35
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,280
Throw him out!

36
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:44,640
Move!

37
00:01:46,319 --> 00:01:47,280
You're Linna, right?

38
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:49,879
I'm David!

39
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:52,400
I'm here to talk business with you!

40
00:01:52,599 --> 00:01:55,400
A deal that can save Yunding a fortune!

41
00:01:55,400 --> 00:01:56,480
Watch your mouth.

42
00:01:57,799 --> 00:02:00,120
Since when do you have anything to do with business?

43
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,719
These are for the core area of Chengbei Old Street—

44
00:02:05,719 --> 00:02:07,920
fourteen property transfer contracts!

45
00:02:08,159 --> 00:02:09,120
Fourteen properties?!

46
00:02:13,319 --> 00:02:13,919
How about that?

47
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:16,240
Can I see your boss now?

48
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,039
No, you can't.

49
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,400
The boss is away on business.

50
00:02:23,479 --> 00:02:24,599
Fourteen properties...

51
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:25,800
He swiped my card,

52
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:27,560
bought my houses, and put them under his name?!

53
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:28,879
Yes, Chairwoman Shen.

54
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:30,159
I just checked it against

55
00:02:30,159 --> 00:02:31,479
the newly released internal master plan.

56
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:32,560
All fourteen of his properties,

57
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:33,520
without exception,

58
00:02:33,759 --> 00:02:35,719
fall squarely in the core demolition zone.

59
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:37,080
This Ma Dawei...

60
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:38,759
He has some serious dumb luck.

61
00:02:41,039 --> 00:02:43,120
I thought he was just some newly rich punk,

62
00:02:43,199 --> 00:02:44,319
completely lacking vision.

63
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:46,919
Turns out he used my card

64
00:02:46,919 --> 00:02:49,159
as capital to start making a fortune out of thin air,

65
00:02:49,599 --> 00:02:51,759
and dared to snatch the deal right on my turf!

66
00:02:57,599 --> 00:02:58,080
All right.

67
00:02:58,439 --> 00:02:59,800
I'll handle this matter.

68
00:03:00,599 --> 00:03:02,240
Are you going to see him in person?

69
00:03:02,599 --> 00:03:03,560
If he finds out

70
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:05,120
you're the boss of Yunding Group,

71
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:06,199
then the money...

72
00:03:06,199 --> 00:03:07,159
In his dreams.

73
00:03:07,759 --> 00:03:09,000
Anyone can cry poor.

74
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:10,360
Go find him for me.

75
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,080
Yes, ma'am.

76
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:11,960
I'll get right on it.

77
00:03:16,319 --> 00:03:17,120
Dawei,

78
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:18,759
your designs are pure genius!

79
00:03:19,159 --> 00:03:20,680
The southern buyers saw the samples,

80
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:22,360
and ordered 100,000 pieces on the spot!

81
00:03:22,639 --> 00:03:24,039
They even wired the deposit!

82
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:26,560
Uncle Dong,

83
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:28,000
since the clothes sell so well,

84
00:03:28,159 --> 00:03:29,479
let's set the terms of our partnership.

85
00:03:29,879 --> 00:03:30,960
From now on, for my designs,

86
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:32,199
I want 40 percent of the profits.

87
00:03:32,599 --> 00:03:33,840
Forty percent?!

88
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:36,240
Ma Dawei!

89
00:03:36,759 --> 00:03:38,039
Have you gone crazy from being broke?

90
00:03:38,759 --> 00:03:40,680
All you did was draw a few sketches!

91
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:42,159
The fabric, the labor,

92
00:03:42,159 --> 00:03:43,960
the machines and channels are all ours!

93
00:03:44,199 --> 00:03:46,159
How dare you ask for 40 percent just like that?

94
00:03:46,919 --> 00:03:48,560
Because without these sketches of mine,

95
00:03:48,719 --> 00:03:50,159
your factory wouldn't even be able to pay

96
00:03:50,159 --> 00:03:50,960
next month's utility bills!

97
00:03:51,159 --> 00:03:52,039
Besides,

98
00:03:52,159 --> 00:03:53,919
with a top designer like me around,

99
00:03:54,199 --> 00:03:56,120
Jinhua Garment Factory will only grow bigger.

100
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:58,520
Don't you want Jinhua Garment Factory

101
00:03:58,599 --> 00:03:59,800
to expand a hundred times over?

102
00:04:01,199 --> 00:04:01,599
Dad!

103
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:02,680
Don't listen to him!

104
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:03,840
Patterns like these?

105
00:04:03,919 --> 00:04:05,000
Even the senior tailors in our factory

106
00:04:05,319 --> 00:04:06,840
could copy them at a glance!

107
00:04:07,919 --> 00:04:08,759
Stop talking nonsense!

108
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:10,039
If it weren't for Dawei,

109
00:04:10,039 --> 00:04:11,719
have you forgotten how terrible our sales were?

110
00:04:12,199 --> 00:04:12,960
In business,

111
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:14,719
being short-sighted is the biggest mistake.

112
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:16,920
I believe Dawei can design

113
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:18,240
even more and better clothes!

114
00:04:18,519 --> 00:04:19,000
All right,

115
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:20,160
stop making a fuss here.

116
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:21,839
Go to the workshop and oversee shipments!

117
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:25,680
Ma Dawei,

118
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:28,800
let's see what tricks you can pull next!

119
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:32,000
Dawei,

120
00:04:32,439 --> 00:04:33,639
she's just hot-tempered.

121
00:04:33,879 --> 00:04:35,040
Don't take it to heart.

122
00:04:35,319 --> 00:04:35,879
No worries.

123
00:04:36,399 --> 00:04:37,240
Here's what I'm thinking.

124
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:39,839
Let's not count by individual styles.

125
00:04:39,959 --> 00:04:42,000
I'll give you a 40 percent stake

126
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:43,279
in our factory.

127
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:44,720
What do you think?

128
00:04:45,199 --> 00:04:45,759
From now on,

129
00:04:45,879 --> 00:04:47,040
the profits of this factory...

130
00:04:47,319 --> 00:04:48,240
the two of us

131
00:04:48,519 --> 00:04:49,480
will make together.

132
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,839
Pleasure doing business, Uncle Dong.

133
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:52,480
Great!

134
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:54,439
Pleasure doing business!

135
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:55,360
Come on, come on.

136
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:56,720
Careful now.

137
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:57,519
Let me give you a hand. Here.

138
00:04:58,360 --> 00:04:58,920
Hold it steady.

139
00:04:59,240 --> 00:04:59,680
Got it.

140
00:05:18,079 --> 00:05:18,959
Just put it right here.

141
00:05:30,879 --> 00:05:31,480
Who is it?

142
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:36,519
Ma Dawei.

143
00:05:48,199 --> 00:05:50,279
Sis, you finally recognized me.

144
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:52,560
The other day, you turned and walked away when you saw me.

145
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:54,319
I thought you didn't want the money back.

146
00:05:54,319 --> 00:05:55,240
Look at you.

147
00:05:55,759 --> 00:05:56,439
You left a card,

148
00:05:56,439 --> 00:05:57,680
without even leaving a name.

149
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:59,920
I could barely eat or sleep these past few days.

150
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:01,480
I felt so uneasy.

151
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:02,240
Really?

152
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:04,879
From the way you swiped my card,

153
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:07,279
you seemed pretty comfortable.

154
00:06:12,879 --> 00:06:13,720
I was just...

155
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,199
testing the credit limit.

156
00:06:16,519 --> 00:06:17,319
In a single day,

157
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:20,680
you tested 2.89 million of my limit.

158
00:06:20,839 --> 00:06:21,639
That much?

159
00:06:23,839 --> 00:06:24,959
That is a bit much.

160
00:06:27,399 --> 00:06:29,639
Isn't that my fee for that night's hard work?

161
00:06:29,639 --> 00:06:30,959
Over two million for one night?

162
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:33,319
Let's get one thing straight.

163
00:06:33,720 --> 00:06:34,920
I didn't even sleep with you that night.

164
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:37,439
You didn't sleep with me?

165
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,920
Then you're worth even less.

166
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:40,319
Out with it.

167
00:06:40,639 --> 00:06:41,360
This debt,

168
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:42,800
how do you plan to settle it?

169
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:46,480
Rich lady,

170
00:06:46,480 --> 00:06:46,720
I'll pay this money right—

171
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:47,879
Who's your sister?

172
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:50,800
Then what's your name, beautiful?

173
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,040
Shen.

174
00:06:53,879 --> 00:06:54,480
Yiyi.

175
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:55,120
Nice name.

176
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:56,319
Sis Yi,

177
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:58,560
I didn't waste this money.

178
00:06:58,759 --> 00:06:59,600
I invested it.

179
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:02,079
You sure didn't waste it.

180
00:07:02,279 --> 00:07:04,680
You used my money to buy my own land.

181
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:09,560
This money,

182
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:11,480
I can't pay it back right now.

183
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:12,399
But...

184
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:13,680
I can give you some interest first.

185
00:07:13,959 --> 00:07:14,759
Interest?

186
00:07:16,439 --> 00:07:17,319
Something good.

187
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:35,759
Mr. Zhao,

188
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:37,519
Yunding Group is pressing us hard.

189
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:39,160
They said the official government directive

190
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:40,480
has already been approved,

191
00:07:40,839 --> 00:07:43,439
and told us to negotiate demolition terms.

192
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:44,600
They gave a strict warning, too:

193
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:46,560
absolutely do not clash with the owners.

194
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,120
Clash?

195
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:50,800
I'm not going to clash with them.

196
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:53,639
Right now, the city

197
00:07:54,199 --> 00:07:55,720
hasn't issued a formal announcement.

198
00:07:56,160 --> 00:07:57,600
Those bumpkins in Chengbei

199
00:07:57,800 --> 00:07:59,759
have no idea their rundown houses

200
00:07:59,959 --> 00:08:01,879
are about to fetch sky-high prices!

201
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:04,319
Before word gets out,

202
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:06,040
we need to buy them dirt-cheap

203
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:07,600
and transfer all those properties

204
00:08:07,879 --> 00:08:09,600
under our company's name.

205
00:08:09,759 --> 00:08:10,680
When the time comes,

206
00:08:10,680 --> 00:08:12,680
once Yunding's compensation arrives,

207
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:14,720
every penny will go straight into

208
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:16,800
Zhao's Construction's pockets!

209
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:19,879
That's what an information gap is.

210
00:08:20,319 --> 00:08:21,040
Get it?

211
00:08:21,959 --> 00:08:24,000
You're brilliant, Mr. Zhao!

212
00:08:24,279 --> 00:08:25,600
Cut the brown-nosing.

213
00:08:27,399 --> 00:08:29,279
Did you check into those residents

214
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:30,600
like I told you to?

215
00:08:30,839 --> 00:08:31,360
Mr. Zhao...

216
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:33,159
we ran into an issue.

217
00:08:33,639 --> 00:08:35,600
The owners who wanted to sell

218
00:08:35,600 --> 00:08:37,279
had listed their homes with agencies.

219
00:08:37,279 --> 00:08:38,240
Fourteen properties in total.

220
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:42,559
But two days ago, someone bought them all up.

221
00:08:43,039 --> 00:08:45,159
The buyer behind all 14 properties

222
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:48,000
seems to be Zhou Qian's ex-boyfriend,

223
00:08:48,799 --> 00:08:49,720
that guy named...

224
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:51,360
Ma Dawei.

225
00:08:51,360 --> 00:08:52,279
Ma Dawei?

226
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:54,759
Who the hell is that nobody?

227
00:08:55,559 --> 00:08:57,200
Just some broke punk.

228
00:08:57,200 --> 00:08:58,879
His family is buried in debt.

229
00:08:59,039 --> 00:09:01,039
Who knows what shady angle he worked

230
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,559
to have money to buy properties!

231
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:07,320
I, Zhao Gang, have ruled Nancheng for years.

232
00:09:07,639 --> 00:09:09,639
No one has ever dared to steal from my plate!
